    'archi-p2023-q25': { q: 'Convert 325 into its single-precision IEEE-754 representation (the three fields, in binary).',
      x: '325 = 1 0100 0101₂ = 1.01000101 × 2⁸: S = 0, E = 8 + 127 = 135 = 10000111 (8 digits), M = the digits after the point of 1.01000101, without the hidden 1, padded on the right with zeros up to 23 digits. Traps in the other answers: storing the hidden 1, using 128 as the bias, padding M on the left.' },
    'archi-p2023-q26': { q: 'Convert 67.375 into its single-precision IEEE-754 representation (the three fields, in binary).',
      x: '67.375 = 100 0011.011₂ = 1.000011011 × 2⁶: S = 0, E = 6 + 127 = 133 = 10000101 (8 digits), M = the digits after the point of 1.000011011, without the hidden 1, padded on the right with zeros up to 23 digits. Traps in the other answers: storing the hidden 1, padding M on the left, changing the sign of the exponent.' },
    'archi-p2023-q27': { q: 'Convert 0.6875 into its single-precision IEEE-754 representation (the three fields, in binary).',
      x: '0.6875 = 0.1011₂ = 1.011 × 2⁻¹: S = 0, E = −1 + 127 = 126 = 01111110 (8 digits), M = the digits after the point of 1.011, without the hidden 1, padded on the right with zeros up to 23 digits. Traps in the other answers: storing the hidden 1, changing the sign of the exponent, forgetting the bias.' },
    'archi-p2023-q28': { q: 'Which representation is associated with the double-precision IEEE-754 word [[3548 0000 0000 0000|16]]? (a number is written $k$ × 2ⁿ, where $k$ and $n$ are integers)',
      x: 'S = 0, E = 354₁₆ = 852 → exponent −171; M = 10… → 1.1₂ × 2⁻¹⁷¹ = 11₂ × 2⁻¹⁷² = 3 × 2⁻¹⁷² (1 digit after the point: take 1 off the exponent).' },
    'archi-p2023-q29': { q: 'Which representation is associated with the double-precision IEEE-754 word [[000A 8000 0000 0000|16]]? (a number is written $k$ × 2ⁿ, where $k$ and $n$ are integers)',
      x: 'S = 0, E = 000₁₆ = 0: denormalized, exponent −1,022 and no hidden 1; M = 101010… → 0.10101₂ × 2⁻¹⁰²² = 10101₂ × 2⁻¹⁰²⁷ = 21 × 2⁻¹⁰²⁷ (5 digits after the point: take 5 off the exponent).' },
    'archi-p2023-q30': { q: 'Which representation is associated with the double-precision IEEE-754 word [[FFFF 0000 0000 0000|16]]? (a number is written $k$ × 2ⁿ, where $k$ and $n$ are integers)',
      x: 'E = 7FF₁₆: all ones. M ≠ 0 (a single bit is enough): it is a NaN, whatever S is. The answer key simply writes “NaN”.' },
